     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Hello,<br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">I have made a bugfix update to v0.60.5<br><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">There was a bug in &quot;dti_create_mats&quot; when &quot;sub.thresh = 0&quot; (i.e., if you didn&#39;t want to impose a constraint on the number of subjects in a group exceeding the &quot;mat.thresh&quot; for an edge to be included). This has now been fixed.<br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">There are also more weighted graph calculations performed by &quot;set.brainGraph.attributes&quot;.<br><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">You can see the changes on <a href=\"https://github.com/cwatson/brainGraph/commit/fabf5f5c3d67566bdea5c732561061025aab2fcb?short_path=8312ad0#diff-8312ad0561ef661716b48d09478362f3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/cwatson/brainGraph/commit/fabf5f5c3d67566bdea5c732561061025aab2fcb?short_path%3D8312ad0%23diff-8312ad0561ef661716b48d09478362f3&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792488251392000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1UYXpynqS68PcZWbJjEJBV\">Github</a><br><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Chris<br></div></div>\r\n"
